2026-10-29 08:34:43 [gemini-4-argon] `PrimePowerAbacus` state, and their bounds are checked independently (p^k \le W and q^m \le W)
2026-10-29 08:34:43 [gemini-4-argon] rather than jointly (u · v \le W).
